<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- SGODOT-420 (不知火舞's boot-splash spec v1.1 §2, iOS layer 1): the launch splash (assets/p0/ui/launch_splash.png,
     1214 × 1618, the SplashImage asset) the screen's height, centred — the engine's boot splash (Keep Height) and the
     game's launch cover draw it the same way next, so nothing moves; past a 3:4 screen the sides are the art's sky,
     #61BBFA. tools/ios/inject_launch_screen.py copies this and the image into the release project. -->
